    'terms.h3':'3. Disclaimer','terms.p3':'The materials on Mygo Kasumi LLC\'s website are provided on an \'as is\' basis. Mygo Kasumi LLC makes no warranties, expressed or implied, and hereby disclaims and negates all other warranties including, without limitation, implied warranties or conditions of merchantability, fitness for a particular purpose, or non-infringement of intellectual property or other violation of rights.',
    'terms.h4':'4. Limitations','terms.p4':'In no event shall Mygo Kasumi LLC or its suppliers be liable for any damages (including, without limitation, damages for loss of data or profit, or due to business interruption) arising out of the use or inability to use the materials on Mygo Kasumi LLC\'s website, even if Mygo Kasumi LLC or an authorized representative has been notified orally or in writing of the possibility of such damage.',
    'terms.h5':'5. Accuracy of Materials','terms.p5':'The materials appearing on Mygo Kasumi LLC\'s website could include technical, typographical, or photographic errors. Mygo Kasumi LLC does not warrant that any of the materials on its website are accurate, complete, or current. Mygo Kasumi LLC may make changes to the materials contained on its website at any time without notice.',
    'terms.h6':'6. Materials and Content','terms.p6':'The materials on Mygo Kasumi LLC\'s website are protected by copyright law and international treaties. You may not reproduce, distribute, transmit, display, or perform any content from this website without our prior written permission. Unauthorized use of any content may violate copyright, trademark, and other laws.',
    'terms.h7':'7. Links','terms.p7':'Mygo Kasumi LLC has not reviewed all of the sites linked to its website and is not responsible for the contents of any such linked site. The inclusion of any link does not imply endorsement by Mygo Kasumi LLC of the site. Use of any such linked website is at the user\'s own risk. If you believe any linked content violates your rights, please contact us immediately.',
    'terms.h8':'8. Modifications','terms.p8':'Mygo Kasumi LLC may revise these terms of service for its website at any time without notice. By using this website, you are agreeing to be bound by the then current version of these terms of service. We will post any changes to these terms on this page and will update the "Last updated" date accordingly.',
    'terms.h9':'9. Governing Law','terms.p9':'These terms and conditions are governed by and construed in accordance with the laws of the State of New Mexico, United States, and you irrevocably submit to the exclusive jurisdiction of the courts in that location.',
    'terms.h10':'10. User Conduct','terms.p10':'You agree not to use this website for any unlawful purpose or in any way that could damage, disable, or impair the website. You agree not to attempt to gain unauthorized access to any portion of the website, use any automated tools to access the website, or engage in any activity that could harm the website or its users.',
    'terms.h11':'11. Intellectual Property Rights','terms.p11':'All content on this website, including text, graphics, logos, images, and software, is the property of Mygo Kasumi LLC or its content suppliers and is protected by international copyright laws. You may not reproduce, distribute, or transmit any content without our prior written consent.',
    'terms.h12':'12. Limitation of Liability','terms.p12':'To the fullest extent permitted by law, Mygo Kasumi LLC shall not be liable for any indirect, incidental, special, consequential, or punitive damages, including but not limited to damages for loss of profits, goodwill, use, data, or other intangible losses, even if advised of the possibility of such damages.',
